ble callback (<a href="https://github.com/slorber" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@slorber</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/4617" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#4617</a> refactor(v2): simplify and optimize sidebar (<a href="https://github.com/slorber" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@slorber</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/4608" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#4608</a> refactor(v2): replace react-toggle with own implementation (<a href="https://github.com/lex111" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@lex111</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/4601" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#4601</a> refactor(v2): increase heading anchor offset (<a href="https://github.com/lex111" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@lex111</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/4467" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#4467</a> refactor(v2): add missing types to theme-classic useTheme (<a href="https://github.com/armano2" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@armano2</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/4448" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#4448</a> polish(v2): Add german translations (<a href="https://github.com/miku86" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@miku86</a>)</li>{"\n"}</ul>{"\n"}</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><code>docusaurus-theme-classic</code>, <code>docusaurus-theme-common</code>{"\n"}<ul>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/4619" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#4619</a> refactor(v2): rename class main-docs-wrapper to docs-wrapper (<a href="https://github.com/slorber" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class=""